WEBVTT

00:00:00.780 --> 00:00:03.200
Wait, what is this strange wind doing?

00:00:03.700 --> 00:00:05.750
Hold on! We can still make it!

00:00:16.850 --> 00:00:18.050
Come on, please work.

00:00:18.900 --> 00:00:20.100
Why isn't it glowing?

00:00:20.600 --> 00:00:22.000
There's not enough light here.

00:00:34.150 --> 00:00:35.550
I am the Origami Warden.

00:00:36.350 --> 00:00:38.650
I protect the artist's first flame.

00:00:40.950 --> 00:00:42.800
Who dares disturb this sanctuary?

00:00:44.200 --> 00:00:45.650
State your purpose, traveler.

00:01:13.250 --> 00:01:16.250
Look at that sunbeam!
It will revive our portal.

00:01:51.010 --> 00:01:52.500
I watched the Maker vanish,

00:01:52.550 --> 00:01:58.950
not through the studio door, but into a glowing
upside-down painting inside the lower desk drawer.
